{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Therefore.</b> On account of this." "<b>Saying.</b> I am giving you advice for your own good." "<b>To your brother, to your poor.</b> To which brother? To the poor one." "<b>To your poor.</b> With one yod — it means one poor person; but עֲנִיֶּיךָ with two yods — two poor persons."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:11.977876812Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}